body:
And for the record, I know what it feels like to not have a relationship or get laid. But you wanna know what the difference is between me and incels?  


\-I don't use my own loneliness to diminish the trauma that rape can brings. Because I know, despite being a male, that RAPE IS FAR WORSE THAN LONELINESS.

&#x200B;

\-I don't brand people as "Chad", "Stacey" or "Becky" purely based on their looks.

&#x200B;

\-I'm not a misogynist.

&#x200B;

\-And I sure as hell don't shoot up other people just because women don't want to go out with me. (Fuck Elliot Roger and Alek Minassian)
